94 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (AI Study Assistant is an innovative Generative AI-based learning system designed to help students efficiently manage their study materials, revise concepts, and improve their understanding through interactive tools. Many students face challenges in organizing notes, revising large amounts of content, and testing their knowledge due to scattered resources and lack of intelligent support. This system addresses these issues by enabling students to upload notes and assignments, retrieve relevant information, and generate quizzes automatically for effective learning.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
95 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Powered by modern NLP techniques and embedding-based retrieval, the system analyzes uploaded study materials and user queries to provide meaningful and context-aware responses. It uses intelligent search mechanisms to fetch relevant content and supports quiz generation to enhance revision and self-assessment. By integrating tool-based logic, the assistant dynamically decides whether to retrieve notes or generate quizzes based on user input, making the learning process more interactive and efficient.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
96 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Built using Python, FastAPI, FAISS, and Sentence Transformers, the platform combines multiple intelligent components into a unified system. The note retrieval module stores and searches content using vector embeddings, allowing accurate and fast access to relevant information. The quiz generation module creates structured questions and answers from the uploaded content, helping students test their understanding. The system interface provides a simple and user-friendly way to upload files, ask questions, and generate quizzes seamlessly.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
97 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Additionally, the system follows a tool orchestration approach where different functionalities such as search and quiz generation are handled through dedicated tools. This makes the system modular, scalable, and closer to real-world LLM-based architectures. By combining retrieval systems with intelligent processing, the AI Study Assistant transforms traditional learning methods into a smarter, more interactive, and adaptive experience.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Overall, the system helps students save time, improve revision efficiency, and gain better insights into their learning process. It acts as a smart study companion that supports continuous learning and makes education more accessible and effective.)
