/E (This file handles all visual styling of the application. The body uses a dark background color with white text and centered alignment, giving the page a clean dark-mode look. Each card section has a slightly lighter dark background, rounded corners, centered width, and padding to create a layered panel effect. Input fields are styled to blend into the card background with no visible border, and buttons use a green background with white text to indicate interactivity. The output divs where answers and quizzes appear use a black background, left-aligned text, preserved whitespace for line breaks, and a fixed maximum height with scrolling enabled so long responses remain contained and readable.)
