<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (This file lists all nine Python dependencies needed to run the project. FastAPI is the web framework, uvicorn is the server that runs it, sentence-transformers provides the embedding model, faiss-cpu handles vector search, pypdf reads PDF files, python-multipart enables file upload handling in FastAPI, numpy supports array operations for FAISS, jinja2 provides templating support, and openai is included for potential future LLM integration. Everything can be installed at once with pip install -r requirements.txt.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
