/E (When a student opens the browser and navigates to the application, FastAPI serves the index.html page. The student selects a PDF or text file and clicks Upload. The JavaScript upload\(\) function sends the file to the upload route. FastAPI reads the file, extracts its text content, calls get_embedding to convert the text into a 384-dimensional vector, stores the vector in the FAISS index, and stores the original text in the documents list. Both are now ready for retrieval.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
