/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (When the student types a question and clicks Ask, the ask\(\) JavaScript function sends the query to ask. FastAPI converts the query into an embedding using the same model, searches the FAISS index for the three most semantically similar stored documents, applies the keyword-based routing logic, and returns the most appropriate portion of the content as a JSON response. The JavaScript receives this and displays it in the answer box.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (When the student enters a topic and clicks Generate, the quiz\(\) function sends the topic to quiz. FastAPI searches the notes, retrieves relevant content, passes it to generate_quiz\(\), and returns a formatted quiz with four questions and answers. This appears instantly in the quiz output box on the page.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
