/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (The AI Study Assistant is a fully functional, AI-powered learning tool that demonstrates how modern NLP techniques can be applied to solve real student challenges. By combining FastAPI for backend routing, Sentence Transformers for semantic understanding, and FAISS for fast vector-based retrieval, the system creates an intelligent pipeline that goes far beyond simple keyword search.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
