>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (       What makes this project particularly meaningful is that it mirrors the design patterns used in real-world LLM-based applications, such as retrieval-augmented generation and tool orchestration, while being built entirely with open-source, locally running components. This makes it cost-effective, privacy-friendly, and accessible to anyone with a standard development environment.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
